<title>POLAND: Wolczanka Q2 net rises to PLN 1.9 mln.</title>
<headline>Wolczanka Q2 net rises to PLN 1.9 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wolczanka preliminary results for the second quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q2 1997	Q2 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 2.81 vs     2.03</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   3.27 vs     2.77</p>
<p>    net profit				 1.86 vs     1.82</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Wolczanka SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				 26.74 vs    22.75</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  17.43 vs    15.48</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		     0.00 vs     0.01</p>
<p>    income tax				 1.41 vs     0.94</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.00 vs     0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     0.55 vs     0.81</p>
<p>    financial costs			  0.10 vs     0.06</p>
<p>    investment				 1.37 vs     1.28</p>
<p>						H1 1997	H1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 5.37 vs     4.71</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   6.20 vs     6.01</p>
<p>    net profit				 3.51 vs     3.47</p>
<p>    net sales				 49.86 vs    45.16</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  32.71 vs    30.27</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		   0.01 vs     0.01 loss</p>
<p>    income tax				 2.69 vs     2.54</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.00 vs     0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     1.04 vs     1.48</p>
<p>    financial costs			  0.22 vs     0.17</p>
<p>    investment				 1.79 vs     1.85</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
